        "true",
        "true"
      ]
    },
    "text_copy": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "jane.irwin@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 19 2017 09:46:21 GMT-0400",
      "text": "<p>Security is a foundational and fundamental aspect of Stryker's technology programs as established in Corporate Policy 11 Global Privacy and Data Protection. Our senior leadership team meets with our Board of Directors regularly and the Corporate Compliance Committee multiple times a year to provide cybersecurity updates.<br>\n</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 04 2026 13:35:16 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "text": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 24 2021 20:31:26 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 24 2021 20:31:37 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "largeheadline_copy_c": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 24 2021 19:48:14 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "line1": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Cybersecurity overview</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 26 2021 13:55:57 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(84,88,87,1)",
      "textIsRich": [
        "true",
        "true"
      ]
    },
    "text_copy_656403845": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "jane.irwin@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 19 2017 09:46:21 GMT-0400",
      "text": "<p>Our cybersecurity program leverages a defense-in-depth strategy that is supported by a highly experienced team of cybersecurity experts. Our team follows leading industry cybersecurity practices and methodologies and leverages Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning to provide state-of-the-art global cybersecurity protection.</p>\n<p>We have strong relationships with government partners, cybersecurity industry partners and security researchers to enhance our cybersecurity profile across our highly regulated and controlled infrastructure for facilities, data and assets. Some of our key memberships include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gartner Institute Research Board (IRB) for Enterprise Risk Executives and CISO’s Health-ISAC<br>\n</li>\n<li>CISO Coalition<br>\n</li>\n<li>Critical Manufacturing Sector<br>\n</li>\n<li>Sector Coordinating Council<br>\n</li>\n<li>Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA)<br>\n</li>\n<li>Department of Homeland Security (DHS)<br>\n</li>\n<li>Anti-Terrorism Advisory Council (ATAC)<br>\n</li>\n<li>Cincinnati CISO Roundtable<br>\n</li>\n<li>Infragard Chicago HealthCare ISAC<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Cybersecurity at Stryker is a multi-faceted program. Our program includes a Tier 1 and Tier 2 Security Operations and Cyber Fusion Center that monitors and detects threat activity 24/7 to proactively gather, analyze and act upon relevant intelligence to defend Stryker, including risk management, compliance assurance, regulatory and audit. The program also includes teams dedicated to digital product security and traditional product security and a global incident response plan.</p>\n<p>Our program conducts security-related exercises quarterly to improve our ability to provide coverage for our digital products and corporate infrastructure, the safeguarding of data and incident response. In addition, our Quality Management Program includes internal and external security reviews of products and systems, and security and privacy by design.</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Mar 30 2021 15:31:27 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "text_copy_689510266": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 24 2021 20:31:26 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 24 2021 20:31:37 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "largeheadline_copy_c_563392076": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 24 2021 19:48:14 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "line1": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Our certifications</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 26 2021 13:56:12 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(84,88,87,1)",
      "textIsRich": [
        "true",
        "true"
      ]
    },
    "text_copy_478724158": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "jane.irwin@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 19 2017 09:46:21 GMT-0400",
      "text": "<p>Our security team holds approximately 120 security security, risk and compliance certifications including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2 Cloud Security Professionals (CCSP)<br>\n</li>\n<li>1 Certified Protection Professional (CPP)<br>\n</li>\n<li>33 Certified Ethical Hackers (CEH)<br>\n</li>\n<li>9 Certified Information System Security Professional (CISSP)<br>\n</li>\n<li>4 Certified Chief Information Security Officer (C|CISO)<br>\n</li>\n<li>1 Certified IT System Risk (CRISC)<br>\n</li>\n<li>2 ISO 27001 (International Security Standards)<br>\n</li>\n<li>3 Certified Information System Auditors (CISA)<br>\n</li>\n<li>2 Certified Information System Manager (CISM)<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 04 2026 13:26:46 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "text_copy_878367835": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
