      "text": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 24 2021 20:31:37 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "largeheadline_copy_c_609193367": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 24 2021 19:48:14 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "line1": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Training and awareness</span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></h2>\r\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 26 2021 13:56:22 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(84,88,87,1)",
      "textIsRich": [
        "true",
        "true"
      ]
    },
    "text_copy_304978436": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "jane.irwin@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 19 2017 09:46:21 GMT-0400",
      "text": "<p>We have implemented annual mandatory security education to help employees understand security risks and comply with our policies. Additionally, we provide frequent communications around pertinent security topics and policies to all employees. These include formal and awareness training such as newsletter articles, direct email, posters, digital signage, town halls and presentations. We provide additional security and data protection training and awareness of specific topics consistent with employee roles.<br>\n</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 26 2021 17:39:46 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "text_copy_934349742": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 24 2021 20:31:26 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 24 2021 20:31:37 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "largeheadline_copy_c_2097789327": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 24 2021 19:48:14 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "line1": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Third-party security</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 26 2021 13:56:31 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(84,88,87,1)",
      "textIsRich": [
        "true",
        "true"
      ]
    },
    "text_copy_1062975343": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "jane.irwin@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 19 2017 09:46:21 GMT-0400",
      "text": "<p>We conduct cybersecurity and privacy assessments on all third parties who integrate with Stryker’s data, network, systems and products. We use a combination of our Security Operations Center and external tools to help ensure that these third parties meet security requirements. We leverage standard industry threat model and privacy impact assessment concepts to help ensure data minimization and adequate data protections are in place.</p>\n<p>We perform supplemental reviews commensurate with the risk associated with each vendor.<br>\n</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 26 2021 13:53:45 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "text_copy_1603871703": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 24 2021 20:31:26 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Mar 24 2021 20:31:37 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "largeheadline_copy_c_1048656359": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Wed Mar 24 2021 19:48:14 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "line1": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255,181,0);\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Product security&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></h2>\r\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 26 2021 13:56:41 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/largeheadline",
      "backgroundColor": "rgba(84,88,87,1)",
      "textIsRich": [
        "true",
        "true"
      ]
    },
    "text_copy_135470331": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "jane.irwin@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:created": "Mon Jun 19 2017 09:46:21 GMT-0400",
      "text": "<p>Product security is dedicated to the safety and security of our global products. Product security is an integral part of our holistic global security program.</p>\n<p>We utilize a continuous improvement approach focused on enhancements to the software development lifecycle and new technical capabilities that reinforce the effectiveness of defense-in-depth security controls used to protect our products.<br>\n</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Mar 26 2021 13:59:53 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
    "text_170992698_copy": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:createdBy": "kristian.bocage@stryker.com",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
      "hideComponent": "false",
      "jcr:created": "Mon Mar 15 2021 18:38:25 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p>For more information on product security, advisories and notifications, please follow this <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/about/governance/cyber-security.html\">link</a>.</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Jun 04 2026 13:33:40 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
